    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a Caf\u00e9 is a game where you do just that, run a Caf\u00e9! Start from a bare bones Caf\u00e9 and become the most successful coffee shop! Be sure you keep your customers happy and your store well stocked! Unhappy customers means less sales, and less sales means game over! Keep the highest ratings for the most business and sore to the top of the chain as a dominant player in the coffee business!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make drinks from regular coffee, to iced flavored coffees and even serve food!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372250/extras/35d16e4337cdbe39d9ce1a4c50811e9a.avif?t=1744139346\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ensure every customer gets their order!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372250/extras/2a10c5baef82389f656ab755c5da9cc2.poster.avif?t=1744139346\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372250/extras/2a10c5baef82389f656ab755c5da9cc2.webm?t=1744139346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372250/extras/2a10c5baef82389f656ab755c5da9cc2.mp4?t=1744139346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch your money to make sure you always have enough  for the daily rent!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372250/extras/622025059619b96d2938a2a2b085bdf6.avif?t=1744139346\" data-has-big /></span></p>",
